<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Sitting Bull returns five weeks after the injection, with the interpreter. His pain on walking is 3 of 10, he walks more than a mile with the brace, and he is riding again. He finished the six physical therapy sessions, two of them by video, with rides arranged for the rest. Naproxen was stopped at his sick visit three weeks ago for stomach burning, which has settled on omeprazole; the H. pylori stool test was negative. He uses the diclofenac gel and occasionally acetaminophen. His family was enrolled in the food distribution program last week. The surgeon&apos;s description of fusion surgery has been explained again with the interpreter, and he has decided. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Pain</td><td>3 of 10 on walking</td></tr><tr><td>Function</td><td>Foot and Ankle Ability Measure, daily activities, 81%; riding again</td></tr><tr><td>Physical therapy</td><td>Six sessions completed, two by video</td></tr><tr><td>Stomach</td><td>Settled on omeprazole; H. pylori negative</td></tr><tr><td>Mood</td><td>PHQ-9 4</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

