    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild left hindfoot pain on long walks</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No stomach pain or black stools</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Sleeping well; mood steady</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>3 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

